<https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#rail_journey> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000015> .
<https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#rail_journey> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A process in which a train travels from one railway station toward another and during which passengers may be conveyed."@en .
<https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#rail_journey_plan> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#rail_journey_plan> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "rail journey plan"@en .
<https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#rail_journey_plan> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000030> .
<https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#rail_journey_plan> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An information content entity that specifies an intended rail journey, including station and service information, and that is not itself that journey."@en .
<https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#rail_passenger_role> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#rail_passenger_role> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "rail passenger role"@en .
<https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#rail_passenger_role> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000023> .
<https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#rail_passenger_role> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/AgentOntology/passenger> .
<https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#rail_passenger_role> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A role that inheres in a person and is realized by that person's participation in a rail journey as a conveyed traveler."@en .
<https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#rail_reservation_information> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#rail_reservation_information> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "rail reservation information"@en .
<https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#rail_reservation_information> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/AgentOntology/reservation> .
<https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#rail_reservation_information> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Reservation information that specifies a held booking for rail travel and that is not a material ticket or a rail journey."@en .
<https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#rail_ticket> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
